			title: "Ember Shards"
			description: ["Every Warden-realm is sealed. A Sigil opens one, and every Sigil is crafted around Ember Shards: splinters of the Crown that burn in your palm.", "Shards come from the story's turning points (the end of each Act) and, now and then, from a fallen boss. Spend them in order: the realms open in the order the Wardens fell."]
			icon: "aldreth:ember_shard"
